    "The 3D chunk figure is STATIC analysis of the built chunks (gzip level 9 of every emitted chunk containing three.js/R3F markers). Actual network transfer differs slightly with the server's compression settings; both figures are reported.",
    "The soak samples `performance.memory`, which is Chromium-only and coarse (it reports quantised heap sizes). It detects a large leak, not a slow one."
